' SCREEN - first AGA screen (PAL 320x256, 256 colours).
' No image is needed. Returns to AMOS after about 3 seconds.
Cls
Print "AGA SCREEN - 320 X 256"
If Aga Detect=0
   Print "AGA CHIPSET NOT DETECTED"
   End
End If
_OK=Aga Screen Open(320,256,256,$00021000)
If _OK<>1
   Print "SCREEN OPEN FAILED"
   End
End If
Aga Screen Pattern
Amos To Back
For _I=1 To 150
   Aga Wait Vbl
Next _I
Aga Screen Close
Amos To Front
Print "SCREEN CLOSED - BACK IN AMOS"
End
